# Forecast-Labor: Real-Time U.S. Labor Market Forecasting Engine

## PROJECT MISSION
Build a **production-ready, elite-accuracy** labor market forecasting engine for Bittensor subnet integration.
- Primary target: U.S. Non-Farm Payrolls (NFP) forecasting
- Architecture: Subnet-agnostic adapter pattern (ready for any Bittensor subnet)
- Deployment: Two-zone architecture (Zone 1: private training, Zone 2: subnet-facing inference)

